    "grp_igbp": {
      "igbp": "CRO",
      "igbp_comment": "Cover crops were air-seeded on 2023-09-08 (cereal rye). Corn was harvested on 2023-10-20. In 2024, soybeans were planted around 2024-05-01, reached full canopy by 2024-09-06, and were  harvested on 2024-10-03. Cover crops (mix of oats and radish) were air-seeded on 2024-10-03. These were later winter-killed (i.e., they do not survive cold winter conditions)"
